      "## Protecting your keys",
      "Your seed phrase, sometimes called a recovery phrase, is the master key to your funds. Never type it into a website, share it with anyone or store it in a screenshot, email or cloud note. Legitimate support staff and genuine wallet providers will never ask for it. Write it down and keep it somewhere secure and private, ideally with a backup in a separate location.",
